  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Creation; <strong>CL</strong> 7th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 500 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nA lesser wizard’s cube of gaming functions as a wizard’s cube of gaming except that the game only has a +3 bonus to Intelligence- and Wisdom-based checks, and winning only provides a +1 bonus to the skill or ability check used to win the game (or a +1 luck bonus to all ability checks if the game is won with luck).</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Marvelous Item, Creation sphere, Fate sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 250 gp</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/marvelous-items#toc104\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
